item.description:
Super disappointing podcast guys...

@davidlin_TV, you conduct fantastic interviews but if you have zero input of your own, you shouldn't be doing these.

30 minutes of "let me look up what my guest said" is not what you should be doing.

I can't believe I missed this 3 hour conversation with Richard Werner last year.
@scientificecon goes into detail about how bubbles are created by the banking system (private credit today) and how they implode.
HT @BeTheChain https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=StTKHskg5Tg

@satirenoob The debt is irrelevant if you can make it profitable.

Market cap is the cost to take controlling in the company.

Remember, they sell tendies

Making this prediction now so it's well documented.

@TheRoaringKitty will return to X on December 25th, 2026.

You've been warned.

The technical indicators are warning U.S. WTI crude oil is about to roll over.

Maybe a small pullback before heading higher?🤷‍♂️
